# PART 7 — PAYMENT STATUS ENGINE

Implement an explicit state machine.

Suggested states:

- CREATED
- AWAITING_PAYMENT
- PAYMENT_REPORTED
- VERIFICATION_PENDING
- REVIEW_REQUIRED
- VERIFIED
- FAILED_REPORTED
- EXPIRED
- CANCELLED
- DISPUTED

Distinguish customer-reported failure from verified failure.

Do not equate an expired request with proof that no money arrived.

Only a verified transaction can produce a paid receipt and corresponding ledger credit.

The backend, not the client app, must control payment status transitions.

A customer returning from PhonePe or Google Pay must not automatically change the payment to VERIFIED.

